      "id": "a8ca04e2-82a2-4873-9c21-1440c2a587de",
      "content": "English: Israel | French: Israel | Latin: Israel | Origin: &#1497;&#1477;&#64299;&#1456;&#1512;&#1464;&#1488;&#1461;&#1500; | Vietnamese: Ít-ra-en 1 -- tên được đặt cho ông Gia-cóp, St 35,10",
