      "content": "English: Asa | French: Asa | Latin: Asa | Origin: &#1488;&#1464;&#1505;&#1464;&#1488; -- &#913;&#963;&#945;&#981; | Vietnamese: A-xa 1 -- tổ tiên Đức Giê-su, 1 V 15,8 ; Mt 1,7-8",
