    {
      "id": "9643ee4e-29eb-48de-92f9-249716484fd5",
      "content": "English: David (City of) | French: David (Cité de) | Latin: David (Civitas) | Origin: &#1506;&#1460;&#1497;&#1512; &#1491;&#1468;&#1464;&#1493;&#1460;&#1491; | Vietnamese: Thành vua Đa-vít -- 2 Sm 5,6-7",
